{"id":"d76d3a84b374975c","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-sound-system.md","title":"Sound System","display":"df-sound-system — Sound System","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-sound-system","aliases":["92-df-sound-system"],"display":"df-sound-system — Sound System","depends_on":["[[92-df-provable]]","[[92-df-sentence]]","[[92-df-arithmetic-truth]]","[[92-df-g-system]]","[[92-df-global-reflection]]","[[92-df-consistent]]"],"source":"第 III 章 pp. 28、30、36；第 X 章 p. 115（PDF 45、47、53、132）","source_status":"原书 correctness 的本地标准可靠性"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-sound-system"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-sound-system</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sound-system — Sound System"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"51c43e0240787ebb\" href=\"?note=51c43e0240787ebb\" title=\"92-df-provable\">92-df-provable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"482ac6c3f68b4b5b\" href=\"?note=482ac6c3f68b4b5b\" title=\"92-df-arithmetic-truth\">92-df-arithmetic-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"11c6019276c591ed\" href=\"?note=11c6019276c591ed\" title=\"92-df-global-reflection\">92-df-global-reflection</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c7befd96bd551ade\" href=\"?note=c7befd96bd551ade\" title=\"92-df-consistent\">92-df-consistent</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 III 章 pp. 28、30、36；第 X 章 p. 115（PDF 45、47、53、132）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书 correctness 的本地标准可靠性"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> (sentence set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span> (provability relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"51c43e0240787ebb\" href=\"?note=51c43e0240787ebb\" title=\"92-df-provable\">92-df-provable</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G\\)</span> (standard arithmetic truth, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"482ac6c3f68b4b5b\" href=\"?note=482ac6c3f68b4b5b\" title=\"92-df-arithmetic-truth\">92-df-arithmetic-truth</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GlobRfn}\">\\(\\mathrm{GlobRfn}\\)</span> (global-reflection predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"11c6019276c591ed\" href=\"?note=11c6019276c591ed\" title=\"92-df-global-reflection\">92-df-global-reflection</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sound}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sound}(G)\\)</span> (definition-target predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sound\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Sound}(G)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{GlobRfn}(G)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;(G\\vdash\\varphi\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G(\\varphi))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sound\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Sound}(G)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{GlobRfn}(G)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;(G\\vdash\\varphi\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G(\\varphi))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sound}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sound}(G)\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>是可靠的</li>\n<li>这里的可靠性是算术可靠性：系统只证明在标准自然数结构中为真的句子</li>\n<li>它不同于“每个逻辑有效式都可证”或“定理在所有结构中有效”</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sound}(G)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Con}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sound}(G)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\)</span>（标准模型不能同时满足一个句子及其否定）</li>\n<li>可靠性比一致性更强</li>\n<li>对同时有效可公理化且包含足够算术的可靠系统，相应Gödel句才可断言真而不可证；可靠性一项本身不提供对角化所需的有效编码</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>原书 correctness 对开放公式指其全部数码实例为真；本文 Sound 只对可证闭句表述标准可靠性。原书原生 PE/PA 的全部公式正确性已见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"678e4ae13575ec1c\" href=\"?note=678e4ae13575ec1c\" title=\"92-thm-smullyan-correctness\">92-thm-smullyan-correctness</a>。这一元语言性质不能当作系统内部可证的反射模式。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"51c43e0240787ebb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-provable]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-arithmetic-truth","status":"resolved","id":"482ac6c3f68b4b5b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-arithmetic-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-g-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-global-reflection","status":"resolved","id":"11c6019276c591ed","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-global-reflection]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"c7befd96bd551ade","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-consistent]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sent}_G$ (sentence set, see [[92-df-sentence]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"51c43e0240787ebb","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\vdash$ (provability relation, see [[92-df-provable]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-arithmetic-truth","status":"resolved","id":"482ac6c3f68b4b5b","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G$ (standard arithmetic truth, see [[92-df-arithmetic-truth]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-global-reflection","status":"resolved","id":"11c6019276c591ed","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GlobRfn}$ (global-reflection predicate, see [[92-df-global-reflection]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-smullyan-correctness","status":"resolved","id":"678e4ae13575ec1c","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Source]","excerpt":"原书 correctness 对开放公式指其全部数码实例为真；本文 Sound 只对可证闭句表述标准可靠性。原书原生 PE/PA 的全部公式正确性已见 [[92-thm-smullyan-correctness]]。这一元语言性质不能当作系统内部可证的反射模式。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GlobRfn}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sound}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sound\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Sound}(G)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{GlobRfn}(G)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;(G\\vdash\\varphi\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G(\\varphi))","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sound}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sound}(G)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Con}(G)","display":false}],"bytes":1985,"backlinks":[{"id":"75be5f3bdd0be0c7","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sound}(G)$ (arithmetic soundness, see [[92-df-sound-system]])"},{"id":"a5f0372880e1fccb","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sound}(G)$ (standard arithmetic soundness, see [[92-df-sound-system]])"},{"id":"28f4d899d4e85281","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sound}(G)$ (arithmetical soundness of the formal system, see [[92-df-sound-system]])"},{"id":"8086f2be7f666ab6","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sound}(G)$ (arithmetical soundness of the formal system, see [[92-df-sound-system]])"},{"id":"ea730faf0a9f37d4","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"cd4abe4b1f57f7bb","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sound}$ (arithmetic-soundness predicate, see [[92-df-sound-system]])"},{"id":"f9c46ba810e9de83","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sound}(G)$ (soundness, see [[92-df-sound-system]])"},{"id":"2e79b6767e33bac3","anchor":"ref-17","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sound}(G)$ (arithmetic soundness, see [[92-df-sound-system]])"},{"id":"a317f5836d8736b5","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sound}(G)$ : $G$可靠 (see [[92-df-sound-system]])"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-189","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-sound-system]]"}],"outgoing":["51c43e0240787ebb","90f32e29c9d553ed","482ac6c3f68b4b5b","e0eabee5d77258a7","11c6019276c591ed","c7befd96bd551ade","678e4ae13575ec1c"]}